WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
I already have the song,

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.613
now I want to turn it into a whole video

00:00:03.613 --> 00:00:04.840
without leaving Suno.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.057
With Visuals, I can create the images,

00:00:07.057 --> 00:00:07.881
bring them to life,

00:00:07.881 --> 00:00:09.904
build the video shot by shot,

00:00:09.904 --> 00:00:12.600
and edit everything around the music right here.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.974
♪ If the world runs out, I'll find another way ♪

00:00:36.974 --> 00:00:43.560
♪ If the sky is here, I'll go beyond it anyway ♪

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.289
♪ I've gone past the edge for you ♪

00:00:49.289 --> 00:00:52.623
♪ past everything I've ever known ♪

00:00:52.623 --> 00:00:56.301
♪ Through the stars, through the blue ♪

00:00:56.301 --> 00:00:59.980
♪ whatever leads me back to you ♪

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.870
♪ I've gone past the edge for you ♪

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:13.740
♪ I've gone past the edge for you ♪
